## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of user consent management, data retention policies, and privacy-preserving API design in a real-world context.

## Key Concepts
- Consent management and revocation handling
- Data retention and purging policies
- Privacy-preserving scoring architecture
- API versioning for backward compatibility
- Deterministic scoring for reproducibility

## Code Example
```javascript
async function computeCcaScore(input, consent, userIdHashed) {
  if (!consent) {
    return { cca_score: null, reason: 'consent_required' };
  }
  const score = Object.values(input).reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) % 100;
  await persistence.saveScore(userIdHashed, { score, timestamp: Date.now() });
  return { cca_score: String(score) };
}
```

